[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3089750360","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108728#issuecomment-3089750360","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108728","id":3089750360,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64KdlY","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-18T14:50:28Z","updated_at":"2025-07-18T17:21:36Z","body":"When testing this PR with a dark scene, I noticed some remaining issues (not strictly related to this PR, as it also affects light on static objects):\r\n\r\nThe parameters mentioned in each heading are defined in the Environment resource's Sky section.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [Lightmap_dark.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21318681/Lightmap_dark.zip)\r\n\r\n### Energy Multiplier = 0.01, Intensity = 300 nt\r\n\r\n*Ambient light is too bright: we see a blue hue, but we should get basically no baked ambient light here.*\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250718_164543\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fd44ec5b-f71e-43ca-898b-214b4a485bfe\" />\r\n\r\n### Energy Multiplier = 1.0, Intensity = 300 nt\r\n\r\n*Looks OK.*\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250718_164610\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/582adbec-3c28-4dcf-aca8-bba185f06892\" />\r\n\r\n### Energy Multiplier = 0.01, Intensity = 30,000 nt\r\n\r\n*Notice how ambient baked light is darker than before. This is unexpected; it should be the exact same as the above screenshot.*\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250718_164641\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0120dab2-25e4-4dff-8777-446f8a7a2fe3\" />\r\n\r\n### Energy Multiplier = 1.0, Intensity = 30,000 nt\r\n\r\n*Being too bright is expected here, given I set exposure in CameraAttributes to 1600 ISO and left autoexposure disabled.*\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250718_164655\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/61b7812b-a594-4a73-a1ec-6a9653de725c\" />","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3089750360/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3089877875","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108728#issuecomment-3089877875","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108728","id":3089877875,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64K8tz","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starr